        "value": "CERT-In Table 9 defines four different field sets — Algorithms, Keys, Protocols and Certificates — not one, so this report has no single \"Components\" sheet and no single per-field coverage percentage the way an SBOM does. Each asset type has its own inventory sheet, showing only that type's fields, and the Crypto Field Coverage sheet scores each type against its own field set. Merging them into one table would score a certificate against a key's fields and report a false gap, or the reverse."
